# w6_podesigned.lj4s - W2 INT-s9-PODESIGNED (W6 fidelity): a poDesigned form that forms.ini does not know yet opens at its
# DFM Left / Top (TBGCueForm 403,208), and a poMainFormCenter form still centres on the main window (TAboutForm2, 366x371,
# on the 799x606 main window moved to 100,100). Run in an empty scratch userdata (LJ4EVR_USERDATA = a new folder ending in
# a separator, docs/running.md), so forms.ini has no entry for either:
#   lj4evr U:W6Pos --script tests/ui/scripts/w6_podesigned.lj4s
move main 100 100
open bgcue_form
assert_pos TBGCueForm 403 208
close bgcue_form
open about
assert_pos TAboutForm2 316 217
close about
# W6 must-fix r1 (ME-199): the code-built TGroupForm and THTPGroupsForm carry no Left / Top, so they centre on the main
# window too. TGroupForm (bsSizeable, 4-px frame, caption 19, menu bar 19, client 212x204) is 220x250 outer:
# 100 + (799 - 220) / 2 = 389, 100 + (606 - 250) / 2 = 278. THTPGroupsForm (bsSingle, 3-px frame, caption 19, menu
# bar 19, client 264x302) is 270x346: 100 + (799 - 270) / 2 = 364, 100 + (606 - 346) / 2 = 230. Before ME-199 they
# opened at 100,100 and 300,200.
open fixture_groups
assert_pos TGroupForm 389 278
close fixture_groups
open htp_groups
assert_pos THTPGroupsForm 364 230
close htp_groups
quit
